? Bot1.Hand = Ancestral Recall; Plains; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ancestral Recall.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Arrange(Island | Island; Island)
Bot1.Arrange(Island | Island; Island)
Bot1.Arrange(Island | Island; Island)
